# Standards (required)

Follow **docs/tickets/Standards.md** for all UI and flow work. Key rules:

- Required fields use `*` only; never label fields "optional"
- New-user forms start blank; validate inline (not only on submit)
- Dates: **Day DD Mmm YYYY**; time/duration: preset dropdown + custom value
- Address search with suggestions; "add anyway" when no match; home = house icon
- Tags as removable chips with suggestions; typing is secondary
- Destructive/final actions use bottom sheets; share only after save/end
- No developer-only copy in the UI
- Icons come from the `Icon` atom (Phosphor); never hardcode emoji/glyphs as UI icons

When implementing a flow, read the matching **docs/tickets/Flow/*.md** ticket and update its checkboxes.

Before completing work, run **`npm run check`**.
